		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Dans ce cas, ajoutez :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>GET STACKED DIAGNOSTICS text_var1 = RETURNED_SQLSTATE;
RETURN text_var1;</code></pre></div><p>après le &quot;END IF;&quot;.</p>]]></content>
